    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18284" root="زنى" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَوِىٌّ</span></b>  [meaning <i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to, fornication</i>
or <i>adultery</i>] is the rel. n. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنًى</span>; (S, Msb;)
the [radical] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span> being changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> because
three <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>s are deemed difficult of pronunciation:
(Msb:) and the rel. n. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَآءٌ</span> [having the same
meaning] is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَآئِىٌّ</span></b> . (S.)

